s about your ingredients from our early days in Philae. Unevenly ripe tomatoes from the same batch, bland meat and vegetables.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","015","speechless",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_117","We remember your sales pitch from last year, too. Your reps push pre-made meals and suggest we let Intelligent Plants handle the cooking.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","phoenix_hostel_room",0,0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_117","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_117","I have no intention of criticizing your business model,==W== but it clashes with our core values.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","018","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","That dedication ensures your consistent flavor and pricing.==W== No wonder you command strong customer loyalty.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","I dine here often myself. It is a loss for Philae if this place ever loses its authentic touch.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","014","shy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_117","Oh, um...==W== Thank you?==W== To avoid any misunderstandings, I realize that United Harvest Philae today is not the old United Harvest.",0,""],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_117","a","002","star",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_117","The bread coming out of your bakeries smells amazing. I hear the praise from our own customers.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_117","a","002","hap